<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-S&amp;P affirms News Corp BBB rating.</title>
<headline>RTRS-S&amp;P affirms News Corp BBB rating.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard and Poor's Corp said on Monday it affirmed the BBB corporate credit rating of News Corp Ltd but revised the outlook to negative from stable.  </p>
<p>S&amp;P sid its action is based on concern about the level of MCI Communication Corp's continued interest in the ASkyB direct broadcast satellite venture.</p>
<p>It said maintenance of the rating assumes that News Corp will find new equity partners to support the U.S. venture and that a meaningful improvement in operating performance is achieved.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
